                                            <SD SI="Failure_Criteria_Test_Result_NOK" TI="TI_1567710450">No message has been received from VCU(0x260&amp;0x236   has not been received for continuous 200ms or 0x507&amp;0x511 has not been received for continuous 1000ms)</SD>
